        "raw": "Every once in a while, I'll stream a game against Miss Information and lose, and every time, my first thought is always, \"Why are they playing the Editor's Note theme?\"\n\nI think the chin tucks are a good ad for the Patreon, we've all been doing them all weekend and thus have a four-day lead on spinal health over the rest of the listeners. :D The Letters Page, it's good for you actually!\n\nI wonder what the chances are of us getting chin tuck contect in Definitive Edition. <_< I could see Stuntman doing level 7 chin tucks, along with the semi truck splits, for Training Montage?\n\nI still need to get myself a giant Cheez-It, dammit.\n\nI am SO looking forward to the next PGP now. :D\n\nNo shade, but the reveal that metaverse C&A are boomers is very \"idea created as a young/pre-teen\". XD \"And by the 90's, with the comics boom, we'll be grown adults!\" kind of thing.\n\nOoh, I can take credit for the outro gag! XD",
