        "created_at": "2024-07-24T18:44:20.272Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Tuesday, August 6th: No episode: we’re at Gen Con<br>\nTuesday, August 13th: The Gen Con Live Show!<br>\nTuesday, August 20th: Editor’s Note <span class=\"hashtag\">#82</span><br>\nTuesday, August 27th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#291</span> - <strong>Creative Process: Benchmark Foes</strong> <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/bangbang.png?v=12\" title=\":bangbang:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":bangbang:\"></p>\n<p>Lot of question-driven content for August, but I’m excited for Benchmark to finally get more attention! The Metaverse may have hated him initially, but that’s no reason for the Meta-Metaverse to do him dirty!</p>",
